WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.420 --> 01:42.380
[Episode 6]

01:49.760 --> 01:50.540
This is

01:50.640 --> 01:51.900
the Ascendance Sect?

01:54.400 --> 01:55.180
What are

01:56.760 --> 01:57.820
all these things?

01:58.230 --> 01:59.050
Your Highness,

01:59.920 --> 02:00.980
they're humans.

02:03.480 --> 02:04.380
So,

02:04.640 --> 02:05.660
this is

02:06.710 --> 02:07.410
human.

02:10.470 --> 02:14.260
Welcome, Prince Ao Jia

02:14.470 --> 02:16.380
of the East Sea.

02:25.190 --> 02:28.060
Dragon Palace Envoy brings a message.

02:29.120 --> 02:30.540
Master of Ascendance Sect.

02:31.000 --> 02:32.410
Come at once to meet.

02:37.590 --> 02:39.100
Who dares be so insolent?

02:40.750 --> 02:41.730
So, you're

02:42.080 --> 02:43.340
the Grandlord of Ascendance Sect?

02:49.750 --> 02:51.170
Have you no manners?

02:52.240 --> 02:53.780
The prestigious Ascendance Sect

02:54.000 --> 02:56.570
isn't for a beast like you to question.

02:56.590 --> 02:57.690
How dare you!

02:58.080 --> 03:00.010
This is the Crown Prince of East Sea.

03:00.150 --> 03:01.660
What are you to disrespect him?

03:02.190 --> 03:03.660
I don't care.

03:04.680 --> 03:06.130
Since you've come to my sect,

03:06.470 --> 03:08.380
you must obey my rules.

03:08.470 --> 03:10.170
Then let me

03:10.590 --> 03:11.850
teach you a lesson.

03:14.590 --> 03:15.380
Come.

03:15.560 --> 03:18.060
If you can even scratch
one dragon scale,

03:18.080 --> 03:20.850
I'll immediately kneel and swear fealty.

03:21.630 --> 03:22.130
How about that?

03:24.310 --> 03:25.500
Good.

03:41.470 --> 03:42.260
Your Highness.

03:42.630 --> 03:44.610
So, this is the Human Clan.

03:45.190 --> 03:46.340
No need for you to step in.

04:11.430 --> 04:12.290
Impossible!

04:12.710 --> 04:13.570
Impossible!

04:14.000 --> 04:15.450
I am a Celestial Immortal.

04:15.840 --> 04:17.850
How could a beast defeat me?

04:18.240 --> 04:19.980
Impossible!

04:20.000 --> 04:22.250
Impossible!

04:26.750 --> 04:27.810
You had enough fun?

04:29.510 --> 04:30.490
Now,

04:30.800 --> 04:32.810
it's my turn.

05:00.540 --> 05:03.820
[Detached Master,
Grandlord of Ascendance Sect]

05:07.160 --> 05:10.050
Breaths restored. Heavens as one.

05:11.390 --> 05:12.050
Break!

05:32.430 --> 05:33.100
Go.

05:50.190 --> 05:50.930
Your Highness.

05:51.270 --> 05:52.490
Your Highness, are you alright?

05:57.750 --> 05:59.700
The Human Clan is so despicable.

06:00.000 --> 06:01.610
Let's not stoop to their level.

06:01.830 --> 06:02.660
Are you alright?

06:02.680 --> 06:03.460
Let me see.

06:08.040 --> 06:09.660
I'm Detached Master,
Grandlord of Ascendance Sect.

06:09.680 --> 06:10.980
Greetings, Crown Prince.

06:11.480 --> 06:12.610
The proud dragon shall know regret.

06:12.870 --> 06:14.140
Strength to the extreme brings disgrace.

06:14.630 --> 06:16.490
I urge you to reconsider.

06:20.270 --> 06:20.930
Mentor.

06:21.360 --> 06:22.140
Mentor.

06:23.240 --> 06:25.050
Mentor, you've emerged from seclusion.

06:28.870 --> 06:29.610
Your Highness,

06:29.870 --> 06:31.220
His Majesty has ordered:

06:31.240 --> 06:33.050
No trifles, no big trouble.

06:33.310 --> 06:34.220
Yes, Your Highness.

06:34.680 --> 06:35.660
We are

06:36.120 --> 06:37.340
outnumbered.

06:39.310 --> 06:40.140
Turn around.

06:41.870 --> 06:42.900
Before so many people?

06:47.070 --> 06:48.460
I don't need you to teach me how to act.

06:51.870 --> 06:53.930
The proud dragon shall know regret, huh?

06:55.240 --> 06:57.660
When you sought

06:57.680 --> 06:59.140
to exterminate us,

06:59.430 --> 07:00.660
did you ever regret it?

07:00.750 --> 07:01.980
For nearly a thousand years,

07:02.360 --> 07:04.980
you've dwelt in the four seas,
with strife unceasing.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.460
Under the pretext of the tides,

07:06.920 --> 07:08.170
you stirred up trouble.

07:08.190 --> 07:10.220
For the bond between our clans,

07:10.240 --> 07:11.930
we only gave a light punishment
as a warning.

07:11.950 --> 07:13.780
We never tried to exterminate you.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.610
A light punishment as a warning?

07:16.480 --> 07:17.810
If you don't exterminate us now,

07:18.190 --> 07:19.730
you'll exterminate us eventually.

07:20.040 --> 07:21.900
You humans always lie.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.140
I won't fall for your tricks.

07:25.310 --> 07:26.930
You've come with such a crowd,

07:27.240 --> 07:29.340
just to engage in a war of words?

07:29.870 --> 07:30.730
A timely reminder.

07:31.390 --> 07:32.810
Now, let us speak of business.

07:34.680 --> 07:35.660
Some days ago,

07:36.070 --> 07:39.290
you held a Training Assembly.

07:39.360 --> 07:41.580
Many of our soldiers were hurt.

07:42.070 --> 07:43.410
By all rights,

07:43.480 --> 07:47.460
all who struck them should be seized

07:49.310 --> 07:51.410
and punished without mercy.

07:52.680 --> 07:53.460
Unfortunately,

07:54.000 --> 07:55.250
my always speaks

07:55.950 --> 07:58.490
of harmony between our peoples.

08:00.070 --> 08:01.980
He told me not to stoop to your level.

08:10.070 --> 08:11.730
They invite us to the East Sea

08:12.390 --> 08:14.460
to settle this matter in three days.

08:14.870 --> 08:16.140
The courteous words

08:16.600 --> 08:17.580
have now been delivered.

08:17.750 --> 08:18.660
In three days,

08:20.040 --> 08:21.490
we shall meet at Dragon Palace.

08:32.600 --> 08:33.370
Mentor,

08:33.870 --> 08:35.700
we have no ties with Dragon Palace.

08:35.910 --> 08:38.010
I fear this feast bodes ill.

08:39.080 --> 08:41.890
We must go. Courtesy demands it.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.490
Besides,

08:45.360 --> 08:47.850
if the peace between humans and dragons

08:48.320 --> 08:49.650
falls apart because of us,

08:50.440 --> 08:51.300
then in the future,

08:51.960 --> 08:54.820
how can I face our ancestors?

08:57.720 --> 08:59.100
The crisis has passed.

09:00.080 --> 09:02.730
We'll decide the attendees later.

09:03.440 --> 09:04.650
All divisions, you're dismissed.

09:05.000 --> 09:05.890
Understood.

09:06.720 --> 09:09.370
The invitation of the Dragon Palace
of the East Sea.

09:10.670 --> 09:12.300
What a great chance!

09:12.840 --> 09:16.250
I must guard the Sea-Calming Pillar
for the Celestial Court.

09:18.240 --> 09:19.610
Greetings, Grandlord.

09:22.030 --> 09:22.650
Come.

09:22.960 --> 09:23.850
Quickly, rise.

09:25.960 --> 09:26.730
Yuan.

09:27.840 --> 09:29.300
You've been through a lot.

09:29.550 --> 09:30.370
Look.

09:30.600 --> 09:31.420
Wear it properly.

09:31.870 --> 09:32.820
Yuan?

09:32.840 --> 09:34.300
Who doesn't have a pet name?

09:41.750 --> 09:42.370
Grandlord.

09:43.750 --> 09:44.700
It's fine, it's fine.

09:44.840 --> 09:46.460
Even when Mentor has nothing to do,

09:46.480 --> 09:48.220
he still coughs up bottles
of blood daily.

09:48.240 --> 09:50.180
If I could spit up so much,

09:50.200 --> 09:51.610
that would be a true blessing.

09:52.750 --> 09:53.820
To expel the old and take in the new

09:54.080 --> 09:55.940
is the true essence of the Way.

09:56.390 --> 09:57.420
To expel the old and take in the new...

09:57.840 --> 09:58.700
Yuan.

10:01.600 --> 10:03.220
- How enviable.
- Grandlord, here.

10:03.870 --> 10:04.460
This...

10:04.840 --> 10:06.980
Coughing blood isn't expelling the old.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.770
His body seems...

10:11.270 --> 10:12.650
A minor injury.

10:13.270 --> 10:14.420
These things happen.

10:14.670 --> 10:16.770
My mentor taught me long ago.

10:17.320 --> 10:18.340
I've gotten used

10:18.790 --> 10:19.650
to spitting up blood.

10:20.080 --> 10:20.850
That's right.

10:20.870 --> 10:22.610
- What teaching is this?
- I'm used to it.

10:25.270 --> 10:25.730
Yuan,

10:26.720 --> 10:27.700
if trouble ever finds you,

10:29.080 --> 10:30.700
come to me for help.

10:32.000 --> 10:33.580
Look, tighten your clothes.

10:34.150 --> 10:35.460
You're all disheveled.

10:35.480 --> 10:37.010
It's not proper before the juniors.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.060
I won't look. I won't look.

10:38.270 --> 10:38.610
I won't look. I won't look.

10:38.630 --> 10:39.490
Fix your clothes.

10:43.510 --> 10:44.530
What to do?

10:45.320 --> 10:46.460
Sixty years ago,

10:46.870 --> 10:48.940
you borrowed my Gnatsting Needle

10:49.390 --> 10:51.850
to remove a nagging worry.

10:52.790 --> 10:54.980
From then on, you were enlightened,

10:55.790 --> 10:57.340
advancing by leaps and bounds.

11:00.630 --> 11:03.610
Now, a mere lackey of the Dragon Palace

11:04.000 --> 11:06.610
can hold his own against you.

11:07.150 --> 11:09.340
The Grandlord you most wish to topple

11:09.870 --> 11:13.010
has become much more powerful.

11:15.030 --> 11:16.180
Silence!

11:19.670 --> 11:21.220
Only by growing stronger

11:22.200 --> 11:24.370
can one be truly invincible.

11:26.510 --> 11:28.340
We can give you

11:29.030 --> 11:30.980
what your sect can't.

11:34.120 --> 11:36.180
Be quiet! Enough!

11:37.550 --> 11:39.250
There, there.

11:39.910 --> 11:41.460
My dear elder,

11:42.600 --> 11:44.730
why not leave this sea of suffering

11:45.080 --> 11:47.060
and reach the other shore?

11:48.510 --> 11:49.730
You should

11:50.080 --> 11:52.490
simply convert to our side.

12:15.120 --> 12:15.770
Look!

12:16.510 --> 12:18.340
If the last Tribulation Cloud
was a false alarm,

12:18.870 --> 12:19.820
then this time,

12:19.840 --> 12:21.370
this Tribulation Cloud seems odd.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.730
A Celestial Immortal becoming
an Aureate Immortal

12:23.960 --> 12:24.730
is a grand spectacle.

12:24.750 --> 12:26.490
You don't see this every year.

12:27.200 --> 12:28.060
Who would have thought

12:28.360 --> 12:30.650
Kuai Si would pass first?

12:33.120 --> 12:34.370
[Hall of Virtue]
If Mentor makes it,

12:34.510 --> 12:36.700
he could rival the Grandlord.

12:37.550 --> 12:38.460
More than that.

12:38.720 --> 12:40.890
By then, our division

12:41.120 --> 12:42.850
will rise in standing with him.

13:13.550 --> 13:14.010
This...

13:16.080 --> 13:19.820
Congrats on becoming
an Aureate Immortal.

13:25.840 --> 13:28.460
Elder Kuai Si quelled evil spirits.

13:29.150 --> 13:30.460
His merit is complete.

13:30.630 --> 13:32.610
Let the 800 divisions celebrate.

13:40.270 --> 13:41.300
What now?

13:52.270 --> 13:52.890
This is...

13:53.270 --> 13:55.060
Had I not lost to the Dragon Clan,

13:55.670 --> 13:57.130
I couldn't have reached this.

13:57.550 --> 13:59.060
I wish to attend the Grand Feast

13:59.150 --> 14:00.580
at the Dragon Palace as well

14:00.630 --> 14:02.100
to cleanse my past shame.

14:02.480 --> 14:03.820
Grandlord, please

14:04.440 --> 14:05.300
grant your consent.

14:09.670 --> 14:11.770
One alone can lead the banquet party.

14:12.790 --> 14:13.530
Okay.

14:14.670 --> 14:16.370
I'll have Wu stay.

14:16.390 --> 14:17.650
You will go in his place.

14:19.550 --> 14:21.100
Yes, Grandlord.

14:30.790 --> 14:33.180
I've helped you become
an Aureate Immortal,

14:33.200 --> 14:34.890
and you've become my fellow disciple.

14:35.550 --> 14:37.420
Time to offer a pledge of allegiance.

14:38.270 --> 14:40.610
You must go to the East Sea on a task.

14:41.320 --> 14:44.060
You'll be briefed on the specifics.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.130
You

14:45.720 --> 14:47.060
should just wait.

14:48.750 --> 14:49.370
Who?

14:50.440 --> 14:51.180
Uncle,

14:51.790 --> 14:53.250
let me help you.

14:55.600 --> 14:57.180
Why are you on the ship?

14:57.750 --> 14:59.850
You're not on the roster.

15:00.510 --> 15:01.850
Like you, Uncle,

15:01.870 --> 15:03.250
I was added at the last minute.

15:03.790 --> 15:05.130
I was too scared to come.

15:05.150 --> 15:07.130
But seeing the Dragon Prince so furious,

15:07.270 --> 15:08.250
after much thought,

15:08.270 --> 15:09.890
I still came, thick-skinned.

15:11.510 --> 15:12.300
Really?

15:15.200 --> 15:16.700
I can't hide it from you, Uncle.

15:17.000 --> 15:19.060
I truly have selfish motives.

15:19.440 --> 15:22.220
I want to see the Dragon Palace
and broaden my view,

15:22.480 --> 15:25.460
so I could brag to the guys later.

15:26.030 --> 15:27.220
But rest assured, Uncle.

15:27.240 --> 15:28.820
About your reckoning
with the Dragon Clan,

15:28.840 --> 15:30.060
I'll stand by your side

15:30.080 --> 15:31.250
and cheer you on.

15:34.630 --> 15:37.890
You are truly an honest man.

15:39.200 --> 15:41.100
But my affairs

15:41.510 --> 15:42.850
are none of your concern.

15:43.440 --> 15:45.610
You insist on wading into this mire.

15:45.960 --> 15:48.770
Just don't regret it later.

15:48.790 --> 15:49.940
Let me help you, Uncle.

15:50.960 --> 15:51.850
Uncle.

15:52.960 --> 15:53.490
Changshou.

15:53.510 --> 15:54.180
I'm here.

15:56.600 --> 15:57.370
Let go.

15:58.440 --> 15:59.250
Stay out of it.

15:59.550 --> 16:00.220
Yes.

16:03.670 --> 16:05.130
Uncle, watch your step.

16:17.420 --> 16:21.220
[Asura Cave]

16:43.550 --> 16:44.770
I've done

16:45.320 --> 16:47.010
what needed to be done.

16:47.270 --> 16:50.650
Kuai Si now obeys me completely.

16:51.000 --> 16:52.730
That should be enough for my report.

16:53.150 --> 16:56.490
You've toiled for sixty years.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.890
Cultivator, what a great service.

17:01.480 --> 17:03.060
What cultivator?

17:03.960 --> 17:06.140
Call me Queen.

17:06.790 --> 17:09.180
Queen, you've done a great service.

17:09.880 --> 17:12.140
I sincerely admire you.

17:15.070 --> 17:16.140
Jin Chan,

17:16.880 --> 17:19.090
don't be so sarcastic with me.

17:19.350 --> 17:21.250
It's not that I'm stalling on purpose.

17:21.270 --> 17:24.460
The Way sects' roots run deep
in Central Plains.

17:24.590 --> 17:28.090
Dragging them into this won't be easy.

17:28.750 --> 17:29.900
My blood's almost run dry

17:29.920 --> 17:32.180
from exhaustion.

17:32.830 --> 17:34.090
And you...

17:35.160 --> 17:36.900
You old stink bug.

17:37.400 --> 17:40.380
You've been idling
in the East Sea for so long.

17:41.510 --> 17:43.700
You haven't forgotten
the real matter, right?

17:44.070 --> 17:45.570
Don't worry.

17:46.160 --> 17:47.660
The hunter has cast the net.

17:48.070 --> 17:49.050
Next,

17:49.350 --> 17:50.730
just listen quietly

17:51.270 --> 17:53.620
to the moment blood is drawn.

18:12.420 --> 18:15.740
[Jin Chan, Guest Official of East Sea]

18:15.750 --> 18:16.530
The pain is gone.

18:17.640 --> 18:19.380
No matter what stubborn illness,

18:19.960 --> 18:21.420
it's no match for your blade, sir.

18:31.510 --> 18:33.250
Your Highness,
it's just pent-up emotions.

18:33.750 --> 18:34.940
Even without seeking my help,

18:35.310 --> 18:36.660
a few days' rest will drive it away.

18:37.640 --> 18:38.570
I wish I could.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.250
I don't have the time.

18:41.030 --> 18:41.940
Speaking of which,

18:42.270 --> 18:44.010
those human scum are about to arrive.

18:44.510 --> 18:45.490
Father leaves me

18:45.920 --> 18:47.050
to host them all.

18:48.960 --> 18:50.700
Then I'll give them a warm welcome.

18:51.750 --> 18:52.420
After all,

18:52.880 --> 18:54.220
of all your teachings, sir,

18:55.030 --> 18:57.050
I best remember one thing:

18:57.590 --> 18:58.380
Humans

18:59.200 --> 18:59.980
and dragons

19:01.200 --> 19:02.290
are sworn enemies.

19:06.680 --> 19:08.420
No matter how many past grievances,

19:09.350 --> 19:10.860
the humans are honored guests.

19:11.640 --> 19:13.010
You must not breach etiquette.

19:13.310 --> 19:15.050
Sir, you are truly merciful.

19:16.510 --> 19:18.250
But didn't you teach me the principle

19:19.960 --> 19:21.700
of courtesy before force?

19:24.070 --> 19:25.810
If there's no excuse,

19:28.590 --> 19:30.330
I will give them one.

19:33.480 --> 19:34.530
You are frail, sir.

19:35.240 --> 19:36.010
No need to see me off.

19:45.400 --> 19:47.050
My heart pounds like a drum.

19:47.790 --> 19:49.090
Truly,

19:49.720 --> 19:50.940
most pleasing to the ear.

20:14.480 --> 20:16.180
It looks like extra rations tonight.

20:16.200 --> 20:17.250
Mind your manners!

20:30.350 --> 20:32.330
Are you the esteemed envoys
of Ascendance Sect?

20:32.590 --> 20:33.220
Yes.

20:33.750 --> 20:35.570
And who might this seafood be?

20:42.270 --> 20:43.660
Who might you be?

20:44.030 --> 20:46.620
I am Jinli, the Dragon Palace General,

20:46.880 --> 20:49.140
sent by the First Prince to welcome you.

20:49.510 --> 20:51.330
Where is the Dragon Palace entrance?

20:51.720 --> 20:53.050
The Dragon Palace has always had

20:54.350 --> 20:56.090
only one entrance.

20:57.830 --> 20:58.770
Are you afraid of water?

20:59.110 --> 21:00.180
Afraid of water?

21:00.350 --> 21:01.490
Forget it. Too late now.

21:01.960 --> 21:02.900
Open the Dragon Gate.

21:05.880 --> 21:07.420
Fear-mongering.

21:16.480 --> 21:17.290
Hold on tight.

21:18.830 --> 21:19.420
I...

21:20.310 --> 21:20.940
Changshou,

21:21.070 --> 21:22.330
I thought you couldn't touch women.

21:23.880 --> 21:25.700
Good heavens! Hold steady!

21:25.720 --> 21:26.660
Hold on to me, Xuanya.

21:32.830 --> 21:35.010
The Dragon Palace trip is so perilous.

21:35.270 --> 21:36.860
Senior Changshou, Junior Ling'e,

21:36.880 --> 21:38.620
why must you come?

21:38.640 --> 21:39.090
Exactly.

21:39.110 --> 21:39.810
Changshou, are you okay?

21:39.830 --> 21:40.530
Senior.

21:41.110 --> 21:42.290
Are you okay, Changshou?

21:42.960 --> 21:44.050
This is the Dragon Palace!

21:44.110 --> 21:45.730
How many treasures must be inside!

21:45.750 --> 21:46.700
If you grab a handful,

21:46.720 --> 21:48.860
you'll be set for half a lifetime.

21:48.880 --> 21:50.420
We're here to broaden our horizons.

21:50.680 --> 21:52.010
That's right.

22:01.500 --> 22:03.580
[Token]

22:13.510 --> 22:14.050
Senior.

22:16.820 --> 22:21.620
[Plaza outside the Crystal Palace,
Token]

22:23.920 --> 22:24.860
Are you all right?

22:27.310 --> 22:29.220
Everyone, what happened?

22:30.200 --> 22:31.530
Are you seasick?

22:34.480 --> 22:36.530
We're here with goodwill

22:36.590 --> 22:38.010
for the feast.

22:38.160 --> 22:39.700
Why make things difficult, Crown Prince?

22:41.160 --> 22:44.050
Elder, please don't take offense.

22:44.960 --> 22:47.980
I'm the Turtle Minister of the East Sea.

22:48.960 --> 22:49.940
It's quite obvious, isn't it?

22:51.160 --> 22:54.530
The Water Dragon Spout is known
as the Dragon Gate.

22:54.640 --> 22:57.770
Only our Dragon Gate Token

22:57.790 --> 23:00.460
and the Dragon King's direct descendants

23:00.830 --> 23:02.140
can open it.

23:02.550 --> 23:03.460
I have sent

23:03.790 --> 23:05.770
your little boat to the surface.

23:05.790 --> 23:06.770
It'll stay there.

23:07.000 --> 23:10.570
When you ride
the Water Dragon Spout out,

23:11.160 --> 23:12.220
you'll see it.

23:12.640 --> 23:13.420
That's right.

23:14.240 --> 23:14.900
Everyone,

23:15.310 --> 23:16.660
leaping this Dragon Gate

23:16.750 --> 23:18.570
is a tremendous honor.

23:18.590 --> 23:22.090
Without leaping it to enter
or leave the East Sea,

23:22.110 --> 23:24.420
you'd have to dive
through unfathomable depths.

23:25.110 --> 23:27.290
So, I hope you all

23:27.830 --> 23:29.570
can relax and open your hearts.

23:30.310 --> 23:30.940
After all,

23:31.480 --> 23:33.810
the ground beneath your feet today

23:34.070 --> 23:35.380
is the Dragon Palace.

23:36.350 --> 23:37.530
Enough, Turtle Minister.

23:38.790 --> 23:40.570
Don't make everyone stand while talking.

23:40.790 --> 23:41.980
I prepared today's banquet

23:42.790 --> 23:45.460
especially for the Ascendance Sect.

23:46.400 --> 23:47.090
Come.

23:48.440 --> 23:49.380
Please take the seats.

24:11.160 --> 24:12.570
Kids don't drink.

24:49.310 --> 24:52.770
The Dragon King
called us to the East Sea

24:53.110 --> 24:54.700
to clear up the misunderstanding.

24:55.960 --> 24:58.460
But where is the Dragon King?

24:59.400 --> 25:00.380
Father

25:01.160 --> 25:02.330
is indisposed.

25:03.270 --> 25:06.570
He bade me act in his stead

25:06.720 --> 25:07.900
and receive you all.

25:07.960 --> 25:10.810
The East Sea abounds in treasures

25:11.720 --> 25:13.090
and rare delicacies.

25:14.030 --> 25:14.730
Everyone,

25:15.510 --> 25:16.860
please enjoy yourselves.

25:39.720 --> 25:41.010
I'll take them back.

25:57.200 --> 25:57.980
Senior,

25:58.000 --> 25:59.180
you won't eat any of these, right?

25:59.200 --> 26:00.570
If not, it'd be a waste.

26:00.590 --> 26:02.180
I'll take them back for Mentor.

26:06.200 --> 26:06.700
Seven.

26:09.110 --> 26:09.700
Eight.

26:11.000 --> 26:12.250
- Nine.
- What are you counting?

26:12.790 --> 26:13.570
Junior,

26:14.550 --> 26:17.700
when we entered the Dragon Palace,

26:18.400 --> 26:19.460
how many of us were there?

26:19.480 --> 26:21.140
Our group had eight.

26:21.160 --> 26:22.660
And you and I sneaked in.

26:23.160 --> 26:25.050
That makes ten.

26:25.070 --> 26:26.570
Ten from Ascendance Sect,

26:26.880 --> 26:28.250
one Dragon Clan General.

26:29.240 --> 26:30.180
So, the total should be...

26:30.200 --> 26:31.010
Eleven.

26:32.000 --> 26:32.530
No,

26:34.000 --> 26:35.140
there are twelve.

26:37.400 --> 26:37.980
Senior,

26:38.000 --> 26:39.460
who taught you to count?

26:39.480 --> 26:40.770
It should be eleven people,

26:41.440 --> 26:43.980
but there are twelve spiritual senses.

26:46.400 --> 26:47.980
Don't look around; it's conspicuous.

26:50.030 --> 26:51.140
What does that mean?

26:51.350 --> 26:52.290
It means

26:53.200 --> 26:54.860
someone secretly tailed us

26:55.400 --> 26:56.490
into the Dragon Palace.

26:57.310 --> 26:58.090
Who?

26:58.830 --> 26:59.730
Where is he?

27:13.750 --> 27:14.490
I'm going to pass out now.

27:14.510 --> 27:15.290
Pass out?

27:15.310 --> 27:16.010
Senior.

27:17.880 --> 27:19.010
I'll pass out too then.

27:27.000 --> 27:27.770
How is it?

27:29.030 --> 27:30.570
Our poison

27:30.590 --> 27:32.220
is no worse than yours
in the human world, right?

27:32.440 --> 27:33.220
You poisoned us?

27:33.920 --> 27:35.140
Why did you poison us?

27:35.350 --> 27:36.980
Why so harsh?

27:37.790 --> 27:38.980
This isn't poisoning.

27:39.790 --> 27:41.570
It's a test for all of you.

27:41.830 --> 27:42.770
A test?

27:43.030 --> 27:43.810
Pah!

27:45.590 --> 27:46.460
This poison

27:47.310 --> 27:48.660
isn't exactly lethal.

27:49.200 --> 27:50.140
It won't be fatal.

27:50.720 --> 27:52.700
At most, just a deep sleep.

27:53.030 --> 27:54.140
Those with high cultivation

27:54.200 --> 27:56.940
will neutralize it with their own power.

27:57.590 --> 28:00.530
Lower cultivation means faster sleep.

28:04.680 --> 28:05.940
This elder

28:06.830 --> 28:08.620
seems to have decent cultivation.

28:12.200 --> 28:15.050
Did you eat differently?

28:15.200 --> 28:15.980
The same.

28:16.310 --> 28:17.620
My wine and food also have poison.

28:17.960 --> 28:20.140
Then, why are you...

28:20.920 --> 28:21.770
I am a dragon.

28:22.640 --> 28:23.980
I was born with a sacred body.

28:24.160 --> 28:25.620
Different from you humans.

28:25.830 --> 28:26.620
I'm not afraid of this poison.

28:27.750 --> 28:28.570
So you see,

28:28.920 --> 28:31.380
compared to dragons, human bodies

28:31.750 --> 28:33.050
are truly weaker.

28:35.920 --> 28:36.770
Turtle Minister,

28:37.550 --> 28:38.980
quickly present the antidote.

28:46.030 --> 28:46.810
Yes.

28:47.160 --> 28:48.620
Zhenzhen, Ai'ai.

28:48.640 --> 28:50.220
Lianlian, Qiezi.

28:50.240 --> 28:50.900
Apply the medicine.

29:01.880 --> 29:02.700
It hurts.

29:17.310 --> 29:18.380
And you are?

29:18.720 --> 29:21.230
She is Jiang Si'er, Princess

29:21.230 --> 29:22.450
[Jiang Si'er, Mermaid Clan]
of the Mermaid Clan.

29:22.880 --> 29:26.010
The First Prince's bride-to-be.

29:27.030 --> 29:28.730
Honored guests,
please don't misunderstand.

29:29.480 --> 29:32.660
The Dragon Palace must stay guarded.

29:32.750 --> 29:35.620
All newcomers must face this trial.

29:35.640 --> 29:37.570
- I'll go.
- We meant no harm.

29:38.240 --> 29:39.490
The antidote was ready all along.

29:40.310 --> 29:41.570
Please forgive us.

29:44.440 --> 29:46.140
You released it too soon.

29:47.110 --> 29:48.490
I was just getting started.

29:52.440 --> 29:53.660
At this point,

29:54.270 --> 29:55.660
the banquet may now come to an end.

29:55.920 --> 29:58.250
Honored guests,
please follow the palace guards

29:58.510 --> 29:59.860
to your chambers and rest.

30:00.110 --> 30:01.810
Once the Dragon King recovers,

30:02.000 --> 30:03.330
he will receive you all.

30:16.750 --> 30:17.620
Wait.

30:17.980 --> 30:21.540
[Ao Yi, Second Prince of East Sea]

30:22.200 --> 30:22.980
Your Highness,

30:25.350 --> 30:26.050
you've returned.

30:26.070 --> 30:27.010
Ao Yi, hurry.

30:28.550 --> 30:29.700
Your Highness?

30:30.400 --> 30:32.980
That's the First Prince;
that's the Second Prince.

30:34.590 --> 30:35.380
Everyone,

30:36.270 --> 30:37.700
allow me to introduce him.

30:38.720 --> 30:39.620
This young man

30:40.240 --> 30:42.140
is Ao Yi, Second Prince

30:42.480 --> 30:44.180
of the Dragon Palace

30:44.830 --> 30:45.570
and my brother.

30:45.790 --> 30:46.180
Good.

30:47.200 --> 30:48.180
Good.

30:49.510 --> 30:50.980
If his brother is this arrogant,

30:51.030 --> 30:52.530
what might the younger one be like?

30:53.310 --> 30:54.770
He likely comes with ill intent.

30:55.350 --> 30:57.770
Jia, about this rare banquet today,

30:58.240 --> 30:59.380
I have a request.

31:00.350 --> 31:01.900
Between us, no need for requests.

31:01.920 --> 31:02.290
What is it?

31:02.920 --> 31:04.420
I grew up in the Dragon Palace.

31:04.830 --> 31:05.660
But

31:06.000 --> 31:07.140
I've always heard that the Human Clan

31:07.160 --> 31:09.010
has powerful magic and many heroes,

31:09.030 --> 31:09.620
Jia.

31:11.480 --> 31:13.050
Isn't this mocking us?

31:13.240 --> 31:14.620
Even you caught the mockery.

31:15.240 --> 31:16.010
Even?

31:16.070 --> 31:17.380
So, Yi, what do you mean?

31:17.750 --> 31:20.660
I want to take this chance to test

31:20.830 --> 31:23.380
how strong human Qi refiners really are.

31:24.270 --> 31:25.730
That's my brother.

31:26.480 --> 31:27.730
The true intention is revealed.

31:28.030 --> 31:28.810
Everyone,

31:29.270 --> 31:33.290
the Second Prince wishes to spar.

31:34.030 --> 31:35.530
Surely, no one will object.

31:37.310 --> 31:38.090
Senior,

31:38.160 --> 31:39.980
you're so tall
that you might catch attention.

31:40.400 --> 31:42.050
No, no, Your Highness.

31:42.070 --> 31:42.980
That won't do.

31:43.200 --> 31:44.010
Turtle Minister,

31:44.480 --> 31:46.660
it's a just match for amusement.

31:46.680 --> 31:48.090
His Majesty won't agree.

31:48.830 --> 31:50.420
Father gave me full authority.

31:51.680 --> 31:54.660
If I say a match, then a match it is.

31:55.880 --> 31:56.770
I'll follow your lead.

31:57.920 --> 31:59.380
This height is about right, isn't it?

32:00.000 --> 32:01.180
We're about the same now.

32:01.590 --> 32:02.860
Cover me, help cover me.

32:03.790 --> 32:04.730
Come, Yi.

32:05.790 --> 32:06.380
Pick someone.

32:18.830 --> 32:19.330
Him.

32:22.240 --> 32:23.570
It really is you.

32:25.400 --> 32:26.180
Me?

32:27.440 --> 32:29.180
No, he's too weak.

32:30.110 --> 32:30.940
You'll fight me.

32:31.030 --> 32:32.660
Xuanya will fight
in Senior Changshou's place.

32:32.680 --> 32:34.010
I'll go too.

32:34.200 --> 32:34.460
She can.

32:34.480 --> 32:35.050
Me, me!

32:35.200 --> 32:36.090
- Choose me!
- I can too!

32:36.110 --> 32:38.050
Me! I'll go too!

32:39.030 --> 32:40.050
What a racket!

32:42.240 --> 32:43.700
It's up

32:43.880 --> 32:44.980
to Yi.

32:46.200 --> 32:47.180
No substitutions.

32:48.240 --> 32:49.010
You're the one.

32:50.270 --> 32:51.050
Come here.

32:52.310 --> 32:53.620
So, I can't get away with it.

32:57.790 --> 33:00.180
I'm Li Changshou
of Ascendance Sect.

33:00.240 --> 33:02.250
Greetings, Your Highness.

33:02.880 --> 33:04.010
Li Changshou?

33:05.000 --> 33:06.700
My destined opponent.

33:07.510 --> 33:08.290
Destined?

33:09.680 --> 33:11.980
Have you picked the wrong man?

33:12.000 --> 33:13.250
You are exactly who I seek.

33:14.480 --> 33:16.380
You'll be the first stepping stone

33:16.400 --> 33:17.700
for my grand cause.

33:23.640 --> 33:25.010
It's a trap. I can't get drawn in.

33:25.240 --> 33:26.010
When he strikes,

33:26.030 --> 33:27.220
I'll fake getting hit and fly back.

33:27.240 --> 33:28.050
Catch me.

33:28.750 --> 33:30.010
Rest easy.

33:30.590 --> 33:31.460
But what if you

33:32.110 --> 33:33.730
land right on top of me?

33:33.750 --> 33:35.140
I'm using the One-Way
Voice Transmission.

33:35.160 --> 33:36.290
I can't hear a word you're saying.

33:38.000 --> 33:38.980
Then why did you reply to me?

33:39.400 --> 33:40.980
Don't shame our sect.

33:41.680 --> 33:42.140
Strike him!

33:50.310 --> 33:51.330
On my signal.

33:52.400 --> 33:53.180
Now!

34:19.590 --> 34:21.340
Such formidable skill!

34:22.400 --> 34:24.460
Well done, Changshou!

34:24.550 --> 34:25.420
Pummel him!

34:25.630 --> 34:26.130
Kick him!

34:26.150 --> 34:27.740
Changshou is so weak.

34:28.070 --> 34:29.530
How did he suddenly become strong?

34:30.150 --> 34:31.010
Senior,

34:31.320 --> 34:32.530
why did you fight back?

34:32.590 --> 34:33.570
I didn't.

34:33.840 --> 34:35.380
I thought you couldn't hear me.

34:36.000 --> 34:37.170
I didn't touch him.

34:37.190 --> 34:38.010
Why is he acting

34:38.030 --> 34:39.340
as if I defeated him?

34:39.920 --> 34:40.690
Could it be...

34:41.360 --> 34:44.380
He repelled the Dragon Clan's
Second Prince?

34:44.400 --> 34:46.780
Could he be hiding his cultivation?

34:46.800 --> 34:50.380
Could he have really killed Yuan Qing?

34:50.670 --> 34:51.690
It's a trap.

34:52.590 --> 34:55.210
Has he seen
through my hidden cultivation?

34:55.230 --> 34:57.780
And he wants to expose
my true cultivation?

35:02.070 --> 35:03.980
I won't let you succeed.

35:13.800 --> 35:15.650
Such a strong hidden force.

35:18.400 --> 35:20.130
He really is still quite weak.

35:24.550 --> 35:26.260
I didn't touch him at all.

35:26.280 --> 35:28.340
The Dragon Clan power
is truly formidable.

35:29.000 --> 35:31.820
Without touching me, it wounded me so.

35:36.190 --> 35:38.570
The Second Prince

35:39.590 --> 35:41.210
clearly took my attack

35:41.550 --> 35:44.820
yet is lively and unharmed.

35:45.110 --> 35:47.650
I'm impressed.

35:51.630 --> 35:52.420
Good.

35:54.480 --> 35:56.650
Care to test my resolve too?

36:06.710 --> 36:08.050
So, this is the legendary spell

36:08.590 --> 36:11.170
of releasing power from the eyes?

36:11.880 --> 36:12.940
Amazing!

36:13.070 --> 36:15.860
Our sect has no such move.

36:16.710 --> 36:18.010
My arm...

36:22.190 --> 36:22.980
is broken.

36:24.030 --> 36:24.820
See? It's broken.

36:29.800 --> 36:31.380
You're going this far with me?

36:31.800 --> 36:33.980
Don't doubt my resolve.

36:34.760 --> 36:35.570
Fine.

36:39.400 --> 36:41.740
You forced my hand.

36:46.120 --> 36:48.740
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

36:48.740 --> 36:51.560
♪Years splash ink♪

36:51.560 --> 36:53.550
♪Trekking far and wide♪

36:53.550 --> 36:56.860
♪Silent in subtleties♪

36:56.860 --> 36:59.600
♪The task descends on me♪

36:59.600 --> 37:06.010
♪Though millions block, it echoes loud♪

37:06.010 --> 37:11.460
♪Transcending gods and demons above♪

37:11.460 --> 37:12.200
♪Plain and unremarkable♪

37:12.200 --> 37:13.030
♪From the start, plan for storms♪

37:13.030 --> 37:13.960
♪Seek refuge, survive, hide my skill♪

37:13.960 --> 37:15.980
Save me, Uncle.

37:15.980 --> 37:17.050
♪Unyielding, who fates good and evil♪

37:17.320 --> 37:19.210
I can't bear to watch.

37:20.000 --> 37:20.980
Uncle,

37:22.480 --> 37:23.380
save me.

37:26.800 --> 37:27.460
Changshou!

37:27.840 --> 37:28.380
Changshou!

37:28.400 --> 37:29.170
First Prince,

37:29.190 --> 37:30.530
the outcome is clear. Stop this.

37:30.550 --> 37:31.650
Please, show mercy.

37:31.670 --> 37:32.610
Yes, yes.

37:32.960 --> 37:35.420
Since the human is coughing blood,

37:35.630 --> 37:36.740
I declare...

37:36.920 --> 37:38.610
The fight isn't over yet.

37:38.800 --> 37:40.380
No, I'll declare the Dragon Clan wins!

37:42.510 --> 37:43.980
I never imagined that I

37:44.480 --> 37:46.940
would meet an opponent like you today.

37:47.710 --> 37:48.530
As expected,

37:49.280 --> 37:50.690
accomplishing great things

37:51.760 --> 37:54.380
always requires the toughest trials.

37:55.320 --> 37:56.090
Stop it!

37:56.480 --> 37:57.780
I'll lose my life if you keep fighting!

37:57.840 --> 37:59.420
Compared to the Dragon Clan's future,

38:00.190 --> 38:01.090
my life

38:01.590 --> 38:03.090
is insignificant.

38:10.760 --> 38:11.740
Could this be

38:12.190 --> 38:13.820
the Human Clan's legendary Sword Flight?

38:18.030 --> 38:18.300
I

38:23.880 --> 38:24.980
hope my death

38:25.400 --> 38:26.610
can awaken the Dragon Clan.

38:39.590 --> 38:40.260
Bro,

38:40.670 --> 38:42.050
you're trying to kill me!

38:42.840 --> 38:44.170
Let's see you keep this act up.

38:46.320 --> 38:47.300
Your Highness!

38:47.440 --> 38:48.380
Take him!

39:22.920 --> 39:23.860
Your Highness!

39:32.150 --> 39:33.130
- Senior! - Changshou!
- Yi!

39:33.230 --> 39:34.860
Changshou, Changshou.

39:35.800 --> 39:37.300
Come on, help him up.

39:37.320 --> 39:37.820
Sure.

39:37.840 --> 39:38.170
Hurry, hurry!

39:38.630 --> 39:40.050
Why did it just happen again?

39:40.150 --> 39:40.940
Your Highness.

39:42.190 --> 39:42.690
Your Highness.

39:42.710 --> 39:43.380
Yi.

39:45.230 --> 39:45.820
Yi.

39:45.840 --> 39:47.610
Li Changshou, how are you?

39:47.880 --> 39:49.570
I gave it everything I had

39:49.920 --> 39:51.610
but still couldn't defeat
the Second Prince.

39:52.400 --> 39:54.130
I've brought shame to our sect.

39:56.030 --> 39:57.570
But he's already unconscious.

40:13.360 --> 40:14.130
You,

40:14.840 --> 40:16.420
just put on a good show.

40:17.960 --> 40:21.530
The Second Prince won so easily.

40:21.550 --> 40:24.300
He was overjoyed, which caused a stitch.

40:24.320 --> 40:25.460
Is that so?

40:27.960 --> 40:29.010
Yes, yes, that's right.

40:29.510 --> 40:30.570
Exactly so.

40:31.150 --> 40:32.090
I declare

40:32.360 --> 40:33.690
the Second Prince wins.

40:37.590 --> 40:38.380
Junior.

40:38.480 --> 40:39.260
Senior.

40:40.760 --> 40:41.980
You...

40:43.110 --> 40:43.610
Junior,

40:43.630 --> 40:45.050
help me give the Second Prince

40:45.550 --> 40:47.170
a thumbs-up.

40:49.480 --> 40:50.570
What does this mean?

40:50.760 --> 40:54.260
To pay my highest respects
to the greatest rival

40:54.800 --> 40:59.340
of my acting career.

40:59.800 --> 41:00.420
Senior.

41:01.840 --> 41:02.380
Senior.

41:02.400 --> 41:02.980
Senior.

41:03.000 --> 41:04.530
I couldn't make out a word.

41:42.020 --> 41:47.800
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

41:48.470 --> 41:55.170
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

41:56.700 --> 42:02.750
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

42:03.380 --> 42:09.830
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

42:10.570 --> 42:17.690
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:18.070 --> 42:24.970
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:25.350 --> 42:32.700
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

42:32.700 --> 42:39.870
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

42:56.010 --> 43:01.180
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

43:02.270 --> 43:09.290
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

43:10.480 --> 43:16.420
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

43:17.120 --> 43:24.200
♪Alas, our story is short♪

43:24.540 --> 43:31.650
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:31.970 --> 43:38.450
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:39.230 --> 43:46.440
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

43:46.830 --> 43:54.650
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
